<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 382 0 R/Alt(High-level block diagram with four boxes. Three are arranged left to right: "Input Memory (Part 2)", "MAC Unit (Part 1)", and "Output FIFO (provided)". A fourth box, "Control (Part 3)", is below them. AXI Stream Input Data enters Input Memory, which sends values of X, W, and B to the MAC Unit; the MAC Unit sends values of Y to the Output FIFO, which produces AXI Stream Output Data. The Control block sends memory read addresses and control-and-status signals up to Input Memory, sends control signals up to the MAC Unit, and receives control-and-status signals from the Output FIFO.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block/BBox[107.1 618.0959 504.9 720]>>]/K[0]/Pg 955 0 R>>
